  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Advisory Inputs on Climate Resilience, Humanitarian and Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component is for hiring of technical advisory inputs on climate resilience, humanitarian and governance thematic areas to complement the delivery of BRAVE programme. This will include humanitarian adviser inputs through the Humanitarian Support Operations Team (HSOT) and programme funded roles on climate resilience and governance roles.</narrative>
  </description>
